Offer Bluetooth as an optional networking service.

Use the existing service-choice page and bluetooth-service-type. Selecting
a desktop does not otherwise add the Bluetooth daemon, so its settings panel
cannot enable a controller until this optional system service is installed.

--- a/gnu/installer/services.scm
+++ b/gnu/installer/services.scm
@@ -115,6 +115,10 @@
                      '("sway" "wmenu" "foot"))))
 
      ;; Networking.
+     (system-service
+      (name (G_ "Bluetooth wireless device support"))
+      (type 'networking)
+      (snippet '((service bluetooth-service-type))))
      (system-service
       (name (G_ "OpenSSH secure shell daemon (sshd)"))
       (type 'networking)
